# Recombee

> Recombee is a Recommender as a Service — real-time AI personalization, recommendations and search delivered through a REST API, SDKs and no-code widgets. This site covers the product, the industries it serves, customer case studies and the engineering blog. To integrate Recombee — REST API, SDKs, no-code widgets, catalog feeds and integration guides — use the developer documentation, a separate site indexed at https://docs.recombee.com/llms.txt.

